  }
]

These IF‑THEN clauses capture every pre‑condition and the corresponding allowed/denied outcomes for the high‑risk tools, encode the required constants, and explicitly state that conversational assertions never replace the mandatory tool‑result checks. The always‑allowed tools are exempt from all restrictions, matching the policy’s final fallback rule.

